  "title": "Chinese Fried Walnuts",
  "description": "Chinese-style candied walnuts are nutty nibbles that make a perfect snack or add-on to a dish. Walnuts are boiled, tossed with sugar, then fried.",
  "authors": [
    "Valerie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:08:51-04:00",
